# Restart after changes

When a coding task that changes this project is finished, restart the local control plane so the latest code is actually running.

- Stop any existing `uvicorn` on port 8080
- Start: `.venv/bin/uvicorn app.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8080 --reload`
- Confirm it is listening, then tell the user it is back at http://127.0.0.1:8080
